      "english": "Nezumiland!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000044FC",
      "source_words_sha256": "0093a4ffed788e2e4eb0ebc18fd285b68e65ab06bb39d6c7d0dc17bc14f4076a",
      "english": "...\fAren't you just going back and forth over this bridge?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00004548",
      "source_words_sha256": "0268ec63242a947a4674fb5fdaaaadd9193abd3a0f91fb50c6d6fd6ada965038",
      "english": "...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00004560",
      "source_words_sha256": "853f1629432b2371bba740462dd8e7b5852e37d93b96181573c8674d65fa087d",
      "english": "Move! Out of the way!\fBusy here! Don't stand around in the road!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000045C8",
      "source_words_sha256": "1f539174c69777659715439fbb8cac8d0fa07cdd0e1c3956f52f5e8a7735902b",
      "english": "Got a problem, bastard?! That's my job!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00004604",
      "source_words_sha256": "d58d0f22a167e853f8d8c8d162bacd8854cde8cf62ebfcbc763d238998593c7d",
      "english": "Move! Out of the way!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00004620",
      "source_words_sha256": "66c40c900dd7051b008f8184421bdf1ff987d56c6983864156c1d8ba5c6ea880",
      "english": "Gin Tama, right...\fThree types: Brawl, Kotodama and Effect Gin Tama.\fExcept for Kotodama, you can only use as many as you have.\fDid you know?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000046B8",
      "source_words_sha256": "d3ccac4d8b06ff4842e2b69c160234f9ca9e35c43fcff0678eb2a0b102381e33",
      "english": "Hey. All good?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000046C8",
      "source_words_sha256": "4afa7ba4888b2446e4b76fdf27e11227009fa8e2b9bffd257facdea86323df6c",
      "english": "What? Bit dramatic...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000046E4",
      "source_words_sha256": "07826cbf7d1299f5e7fa87e3b6509fad3fabf32198aff821a00c091ed6cff9e9",
      "english": "Mademoiselle...? Oh, Mademoiselle Saigo.\fYeah, bad for the heart.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000478C",
      "source_words_sha256": "dd8262ea905667e0475f524634457581d4b55b20cb033ebf087690447813854e",
      "english": "Just thought some people might not know...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000047BC",
      "source_words_sha256": "eae499ac07da20714601def54e29745ce6200642b0c7bf3cb509b4aeb8131486",
      "english": "Right?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000047FC",
      "source_words_sha256": "200fa360b91a99af4f23c6c4e83ad0b79790be7c7ae7836da0b9827087a59842",
      "english": "Forgot three minutes ago?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00004948",
      "source_words_sha256": "0b3619c8fbc3f900585aba0ad5036c0d5c7c9d727c31ef1069899015847be22f",
      "english": "How am I? Losing Gin Tama battles nonstop!\fYeah... Battles are tough unless you've got a decent supply.\fWatch out if you're battling too, Gin.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00004A58",
      "source_words_sha256": "13994c932a99fe14cc54c2edf5860f07de7282dca1da4fe3023bb192381fc4f3",
      "english": "Who are you smiling at?!\f...Sigh. Fine.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00004AEC",
      "source_words_sha256": "624ba11d75210de41757354359fac13e9a95cc97d77122363e891d016b23298e",
      "english": "Are you a HAMSTER?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00004B0C",
      "source_words_sha256": "dd83120b1eafa2021bad93440f748bfadbb7c04f184a49b362e67495ba39e9d8",
      "english": "...Sigh. Fine.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00004B7C",
      "source_words_sha256": "943758270a7292cf3a4847f8c9e6fb230a3c9b598d4f7a24f8f01f0ce204e928",
      "english": "Huh? Awfully refined for Kagura's friend... Seen her somewhere?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00004BD8",
      "source_words_sha256": "b6ae007590256f870734b40b47667e3f46372db807608e9fa12d10d299403133",
      "english": "It's fine, Shinpachi. She's no big shot...\fShe's Kagura's friend.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00004C1C",
      "source_words_sha256": "8e1f5ce42a3f551180826bb49ab4f253b39a123cc88954929886074c99f3cddc",
      "english": "Wha?! Soyo?! Is that you?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00004C4C",
      "source_words_sha256": "77af075d19be7e26926cc618325ce7c4850f408269424a12678c27c9dc6ed585",
      "english": "What are you doing here?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00004C70",
      "source_words_sha256": "ddf7fe2557bd4e6c872272292e6900df180d574eb692daebbf00ab3ad8734b67",
      "english": "Soyo...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00004C84",
      "source_words_sha256": "8641f42335377738bf5cf8eaa9cbd92dcc514f02538c691b0af01730c390c8cf",
      "english": "Don't worry. You're busy, Soyo. Some other time.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00004CC8",
      "source_words_sha256": "85fe570a354dbef9bdf798eabe1bff1313370a4d0c678b4bef09c09bda25a03e",
      "english": "Aaah! I remember! She's...!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00004D30",
      "source_words_sha256": "7748f7fd36fd6d47168072962cbbfd7a2dfbc0f8c2bdaee5c63b67aab343ad92",
      "english": "Hehe... Buying pickled kelp.\fIt has to be this shop's.\fThe kelp I shared with you, Queen...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00004DB4",
      "source_words_sha256": "58039b028414641d75801d37345b03448a2911ad6b59c99c8c4fba3ac74d672d",
      "english": "Sorry, Queen. I'd love to play again, but there's no time today...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00004E00",
      "source_words_sha256": "fee56bd74142bc54a042a46c1a009c7eefe98d602fdd5e064512a113b9aedda6",
      "english": "Yes... Thanks, Queen. Some other time.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00004E80",
      "source_words_sha256": "37b55cdef1272e7a4fa5f5523f444e7c8bd749e9318f1cc043b1c334ac24a94a",
      "english": "So excited...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00004E94",
      "source_words_sha256": "9e5520e61144e3b55e1ca4939aa6f054a403b89d9f17a8fda6f9612ae2ed60d0",
      "english": "Heart pounding...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00004F80",
      "source_words_sha256": "6eb54d92c4a19c5cf26c473b5755befe66b2263549cefa507c8763c586d9c27a",
      "english": "Oh, Tatsumi. What are you doing here?\fArson?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00004FC0",
      "source_words_sha256": "5fe2c2b4c7bc0e146b9f5e4c9826513e55bfd22830b4cf25936625421808d951",
      "english": "What a nasty level-up...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00004FE4",
      "source_words_sha256": "7b992e5793bdeee6dc1493224f83b78caecbb9b42ca140fb6b0233e474213e35",
      "english": "What about you, sis? Secretly collecting Dragon Tama yourself?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005064",
      "source_words_sha256": "94f6456825e838e75140fc9fb6771e67d5689e94a463f4f1fb015a57df894110",
      "english": "...Well, that does sound like you...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000509C",
      "source_words_sha256": "2a0b1382fe49fc8f94638a7b57841a15432bf114cbe6b2910fa33683c7bfba20",
      "english": "But I've got ambitions too. No orbs for you.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000518C",
      "source_words_sha256": "2acc14ca214e7fae55d6f7757f2d0a961c995287bee30e71afd79bb00b604170",
      "english": "...Urk.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000519C",
      "source_words_sha256": "bebdf2b47b2d926c364ddcd7ed4d85101b44d1ced0c03ff35fdfde5315efeefa",
      "english": "I just... Wanted to wish for a peaceful town without fires...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000051DC",
      "source_words_sha256": "90f6e8cf3f40a8e70d59fca288f4d8c542b8607dbfdd1d4560b5e495ba91f119",
      "english": "Even without Dragon Tama, I'll protect Edo!\fI'm gonna be Edo's best firefighter!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005238",
      "source_words_sha256": "98158782f5b2b980a7d495bdea91c796ed1a694f9067dfc7932c8e687f15754a",
      "english": "You'll say there's a man attached to that octopus, right?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005270",
      "source_words_sha256": "7bfab98dc6549980eb98e85b357bba4a5534844150816fccf649715360069788",
      "english": "Seriously?! You're not separated! You're practically one body!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000052C0",
      "source_words_sha256": "0aa3d3929b260861be05fae0530067308467ee938fde2c183c8e68e0f45e71ca",
      "english": "Wishful thinking?! Eighteen lines for an old man's daydream, damn it!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000530C",
      "source_words_sha256": "14544537d944be454ad6cd36d2b177b9630f1d9a7715e6748383a5c846c1734a",
      "english": "You... Thought an octopus was sitting on my head, didn't you?\fWrong...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005368",
      "source_words_sha256": "d5809bdaa29ea177806b26ae0a4e390c0e6d57d4720b8739fcda69ca6f224264",
      "english": "Close! Listen. This thing on my head...\fMy long-lost brother.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000053BC",
      "source_words_sha256": "13693bf504eb5643604207e39f16eb4765a70341b862865f6ff77d11ba021153",
      "english": "Well, if only...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000053DC",
      "source_words_sha256": "f015eaa6965e510899edb5f8fc6f5ab6f1ab8b8803eb1e25ccb39f3fce319658",
      "english": "Huh? Ikumatsu? What are you doing out here in the road...?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005424",
      "source_words_sha256": "8998f6b648c91b08b68189f68a31c9aa9eea26cfa6347d2df8c8eb314908be6e",
      "english": "Uh... I need to get past...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005444",
      "source_words_sha256": "2f0a75a84b5cb13bdb0427d3fb328ce4c38890e3a3e8bc1a16dbb08e2dc5de30",
      "english": "Nothing...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005460",
      "source_words_sha256": "32f3cc2637edae260226bd7bdf706a3d5746f97bd68c649d2fef8ba51ecfc5e0",
      "english": "What?! Like I'd waste time on this crap!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000054A4",
      "source_words_sha256": "16a3a7ce79906c091c36841d87638af7b2bbef0f47c2c108d62f841c19f74f5c",
      "english": "Bring it on, bitch! I'll settle this before sundown!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005580",
      "source_words_sha256": "c9551df203a9719930ba0e171119a66ae4d196f9e00a3c87c4c4858bc30ddd39",
      "english": "Sorry, Gin... We'll settle this by sundown. Leave us be!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000055D8",
      "source_words_sha256": "f29500e98e36830bfc14cdeac1dc5a1dcf6c6d41b33062a6f366045b938c09c7",
      "english": "Huh? What was that?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000564C",
      "source_words_sha256": "17b92028846a43cb61fca81835976e3c2955760903cb9596376575edfb1cbeb9",
      "english": "Quite a shouting match.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005664",
      "source_words_sha256": "0fbf915eb33e73332c06e1fc645b70ede41d913b8ba85d45b1afc0252aea3d7e",
      "english": "Old man. You're certain it was seen around here?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000569C",
      "source_words_sha256": "bc098976c23a7303efc38d98772ae54a4389c879eda6e63b00bd44e21c8add80",
      "english": "Stefan! STE-FAN!\fThe space beast I've sought for years! You saw it here, yes?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005700",
      "source_words_sha256": "6beb879ce2195ecf880f227ea65af527e1e448b844a1cd563a9efdf1941f48a1",
      "english": "Old bastard! Want a trip through the gates of hell?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005734",
      "source_words_sha256": "fd864aef97a650d8eb45e1a55400832ffbfd299fe17e6b722986cd0566871b69",
      "english": "Where's my Stefan?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000576C",
      "source_words_sha256": "a2fb31787a991b6cead27140ba542d605b5409b84a6a81c5eac2eafb9a0b9dcd",
      "english": "Did I...? Oh, I've got a gateball tournament at four.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000057AC",
      "source_words_sha256": "fa16d9c3c60a517f40f6477911b1d80536df3bd5f552dbea736049ff875bc470",
      "english": "Dunno.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000057B8",
      "source_words_sha256": "7af9c5f02cb0291a318a7b128686e8d4463801c0d2a2bbcbeb1abdce35863e8f",
      "english": "Oh, the divine messenger... Sadaharu, was it? Doing well?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000057F4",
      "source_words_sha256": "fded9d7b918a3e81bda76d837481612b4ae44fe17311c9d18711b05b1ff2a95c",
      "english": "By the way, seen my shut-in sister? Can't find her...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000583C",
      "source_words_sha256": "17ddbbb96728d5ff1bc0cb68a0abfc27f0f54acd122eeb63574413305e076cd2",
      "english": "Yeah.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005884",
      "source_words_sha256": "ecab5d29b3d79b4c8c61a6502b7e1fa5981897eed0ec9fcace4d7d5e8724f6f5",
      "english": "Yeah... See that penguin-ghost thing?\fSaw a space monster just like it on TV once.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005904",
      "source_words_sha256": "a9672cf02b063fb80d26acf6ac4904b01e154657a8d09912d33b7b6b09166a20",
      "english": "No planet's safe lately.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005924",
      "source_words_sha256": "de2a7e1aa15bd334f228d3dc5da040f538a911e4124c62e7c461751277ce42a2",
      "english": "Much smaller, though.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005950",
      "source_words_sha256": "c95210d8e2ab33180df8ee39eba0dff3919d57cd7a7ceabd1f6dcac3eec09243",
      "english": "Un... cle?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005968",
      "source_words_sha256": "3479f60c7334d58608c8c48ab5d24a4ecf91a0d393ea34544a64e923cdba4549",
      "english": "Shhh!\fKeep it down! They'll find me!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005A0C",
      "source_words_sha256": "8b822531d42d89708581edaea0458324bcf9559b9e3913cf4b5d33532a00fc61",
      "english": "Ready or not?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005A98",
      "source_words_sha256": "1d74a05c154024aa3f477d6dcc7184dcf390abff3927a47d7f6070e7539f9345",
      "english": "Okay... We won't spoil your fun.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005ACC",
      "source_words_sha256": "10495202b834e45445bb2a389440f90fa5e590eb3d163f9f9e633d2fb8a6e938",
      "english": "Oh! Never seen this Gin Tama before... Thanks, Uchino!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005B10",
      "source_words_sha256": "b1f4d335643c8d785c1961fb188ec319b706682ad29422c90cb28a6dea749cd5",
      "english": "Slow reaction!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005B6C",
      "source_words_sha256": "39a4df48637d727778f496ae8f97d26f55562ff2f6df8a6bfc58c939ca3ab93a",
      "english": "...Oh, you were patients at our hospital...\fSorry... Could you keep seeing me here a secret?\fHead nurse is such a nag lately... And did you call my boyfriend a rare beast?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005C88",
      "source_words_sha256": "03891cf7f09050d13bb0f0dcd98f855cc6b20df7b76995577323f3de491a0acd",
      "english": "Listen. Meeting him here is a secret. Got it?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005CC0",
      "source_words_sha256": "3073a22f97d1f41fe6d7f48ba913fe6d15041492369e2dbdecb303f25ef21d2a",
      "english": "W-wait a sec!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005D1C",
      "source_words_sha256": "fcf368827b0bf2ca5675fe50a0387bd1ec921590e02a6d4985b242018e3227a8",
      "english": "But everything ELSE was your omelets' fault...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005D78",
      "source_words_sha256": "e4de73ad909643f98d40f9a4fa3217af09d853f5245944536468d5099d7e1a23",
      "english": "Oh, uh...\fSorry. Got carried away...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005DF8",
      "source_words_sha256": "daaf9eb1b9ff45d0251d18aee7bc2016d815277b80aeb585f12bd08c99c32054",
      "english": "Oh, Shin! Doing well? Getting paid properly?\fSurely you're not working for free?\fRight?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005ED8",
      "source_words_sha256": "99365a0e5aeb504da23a4e14564921e92101a6105aca36a6154d15a34dae74d9",
      "english": "It's all YOUR fault.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005EFC",
      "source_words_sha256": "82b3b8a58568af513db9589bedc227014be366e0bf09246e513f4db883d06715",
      "english": "Oh, really... Then next...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005F28",
      "source_words_sha256": "4f009e58fadde8d8c1a34692bd5bd7adb10be769bff75e2e388931dc311b7da8",
      "english": "Your soul next?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005F8C",
      "source_words_sha256": "6b3d7bf67bb41d1048ef0977a78a8a5622e483146a7114a8e0b610c46ea6514e",
      "english": "Hm...?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005F9C",
      "source_words_sha256": "09b6602894905ce52c8cb6c9654b6154ffb4c5c0c9282a49b538ee4f000a4652",
      "english": "All stalkers say that.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005FC0",
      "source_words_sha256": "bbab03850128c449886090ba873e0edb3436e620b6565d130b04389b3c57204f",
      "english": "Whatever, but isn't this an actual crime?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00005FF4",
      "source_words_sha256": "61d8950ec4ec25ecdfbe596e35835a78dd0065fa6aad3d752ac160b42d4540cf",
      "english": "Ai, ai, ai, ai...\fAre you a monkey, bastard?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00006030",
      "source_words_sha256": "4fd65eb7f808e4a243a893210b729f658cf9f33890fbe960be836a7149fd46f9",
      "english": "Otaeee!\fMarry me!\fFor you, I'd die...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00006080",
      "source_words_sha256": "e062249988875be4eb81172e21d408d0e6ef4378b16f2e382c4644a417046887",
      "english": "Bwoof!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000060C8",
      "source_words_sha256": "84600e325ce9b96d4f3c2eb3d1329c96a656bcc50dd3b292a6f025c5462a6c4f",
      "english": "Yes...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000060D8",
      "source_words_sha256": "a33068f48851f17b3dbede520218313c70fe1e03d16ff7a6c70fa84c272419c0",
      "english": "All people are stalkers, forever seeking love.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00006144",
      "source_words_sha256": "db72521d664959405c99b175df9e6e7879456419f05f79598e446ff92427fc77",
      "english": "What I seek is eternal love.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000061F4",
      "source_words_sha256": "65ae8f526659784fa177931e3bc8c9afd9b00cae09e5ae418e7bd416314ee2c2",
      "english": "...All right, Mama. I get it.\f...\fExcept I'm Azumi.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00006238",
      "source_words_sha256": "fd3f35388b1bd6c8101eeae248d78415940a76958fa3bc829ff29a9887cd32e7",
      "english": "Now, now. Calm down, Mama.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00006258",
      "source_words_sha256": "c23db21dedbf40ae7711b648459487a1b683b27f7a097cb1c57af1e3b563c85e",
      "english": "Oh dear, got told off.\f...\fExcept I'm Azumi.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00006294",
      "source_words_sha256": "450015d39e5da32b1a1e22524e288543ef4500a449fa4351cf75ccd539a31f96",
      "english": "Paako! Why provoke Mama?! Get going!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000062D8",
      "source_words_sha256": "d39944c25ea63b69e1d245c7daf639322c7d599b9cc33847158efb680c4d7342",
      "english": "...\fMaybe I'll just change my name.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000062FC",
      "source_words_sha256": "1f86d1cb1f24c596c5f9420f2ffd047d539e53730d47cf409f0a1d79887bc22c",
      "english": "Hey, White Loincloth and Chin. Collecting Gin Tama too?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00006338",
      "source_words_sha256": "fa6d717139cd164ff136fd6ceca1b69e5586647326798f56d08369076ab59670",
      "english": "Wow. Already forgot the conversation one flag ago.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00006370",
      "source_words_sha256": "b2cf1798cffb65931e0815800d0313fa85c6a5624c8777c7c790972629772929",
      "english": "Uh... No more Monster Land, thanks.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000063A0",
      "source_words_sha256": "5d3e693805b86fcff4466f860249580ba1324ebde65575089681696d1a5d6c6e",
      "english": "Sorry, Sister Agoe.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000063BC",
      "source_words_sha256": "0e80da7729c92ec393cb89319279efb3be9630ab720c050a9d61603e59d18177",
      "english": "...Nobody particularly suspicious here.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000063F4",
      "source_words_sha256": "eb9f8800c32631943c4693b0b1416e512e977d88e178e2ba9cc58da1c499416d",
      "english": "Leave them, Agomi. Shinsengumi.\fProvoke them and they'll start digging for dirt.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000644C",
      "source_words_sha256": "a26833b4ed9a4a931617d21b7645709d5bebe4fc6a42101ec0da98a726733bd3",
      "english": "WHAT?!\fWhite Loincloth, fine! But calling my precious girl CHIN?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000064A4",
      "source_words_sha256": "ee84aa3c8a54aff97c89f9129accb46eec794ec3330d71212b02e285990121be",
      "english": "Don't mess with a drag queen!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000064C8",
      "source_words_sha256": "568bb972ec8dd5b3d869ab0c17d0e0d86edd179d64fd8f27b0b4b1744139f805",
      "english": "Quiet, Agoyo!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00006508",
      "source_words_sha256": "cb91670e7f8473b7f9413fc1ddd6a2609b2778efcfaa3aca9da5761e3163576d",
      "english": "Want another stint training at our club?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000652C",
      "source_words_sha256": "1b447c50e8d9474da892e4649d506ea719363a645d63e822f94af1d9abf6d568",
      "english": "!!!!!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00006570",
      "source_words_sha256": "d6863a80dea7edea70d48a7a149aebfd637ec68c3fa0dcbc3d0b24e40f209b31",
      "english": "No, no! Nothing suspicious.\fJust thought you might spare some Gin Tama...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000065DC",
      "source_words_sha256": "5d5f44eef4feca402e3d6cac636e32c8f7834f051721fd75c250c0f24c7ef8f8",
      "english": "No luck, huh...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000065F8",
      "source_words_sha256": "3f8cc7d1981af6e96a52f40e6688087e121af7a3350503f4ef624cb030429018",
      "english": "Guaranteed victory? Big claim.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00006618",
      "source_words_sha256": "550334dbb5c269b7a1ffb62d2b260dfed6d96fe903c16b5c07d65dd216212aa6",
      "english": "I see... Break their spirit and the match ends fast.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00006688",
      "source_words_sha256": "c922df34bb50994ec7ad59be54544e4c4756166d3e0a67a86badf3baa77ec974",
      "english": "Hey, lady. Got Gin Tama?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000066B4",
      "source_words_sha256": "3b1c079b0f4b6e31b55b7fb763378729a537c6bd83cf3fb8f888273d2ba58372",
      "english": "Hand them all over.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000066CC",
      "source_words_sha256": "71d8b5ea3dfbf94fe6bb8b451e2301308bf364092168e41d4a5237bd05196f59",
      "english": "Huh...? Y-yes, I do...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000066F0",
      "source_words_sha256": "36723974d49121cc57655ffa62f48a9e3255d47da9638c9752d8793c0e9ee8bb",
      "english": "What?! Say anything weird and I'll call the police!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00006724",
      "source_words_sha256": "a608958eb31b6ce8789c9bcfb9bc9afbb56169616dd93b25aeeba49e2b54cb86",
      "english": "Oh... You only just started collecting, then.\fI don't have many myself...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00006794",
      "source_words_sha256": "13ffab1b0bcc9d54d92258aa63d9c5163b87434bcc2f126766e76b375ff18c31",
      "english": "I'll teach you something instead: the Gin Tama sure-win method!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000069E4",
      "source_words_sha256": "17612ae6efbeb4d90a6bdac808b10942519d4873a85e69b4f512f2e6f2046691",
      "english": "Normally it's taboo to mock someone's looks...\fBut Gin Tama battles include insults. Let them have it!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00006A6C",
      "source_words_sha256": "b68dd18aa4f5ebcad94cfbee6ed848dd712711d3851fa57b09ab7402f5170f5f",
      "english": "That's it. Helpful, right? Want me to explain again?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00006D5C",
      "source_words_sha256": "05dcfe72184cde002089ff5dfe126fc1c2c493cf05bf0e3c05992f246e09fe5a",
      "english": "That's it. Helpful, right?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00006DE4",
      "source_words_sha256": "6d7d293dac3c6df1dcb8c89d1f8a879872e81b91636150953c3813c4817f5d84",
      "english": "Must be... Radio waves bouncing off all that meat.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00006EE8",
      "source_words_sha256": "642502febbb5aadd9cdde7353e9f8a0db0f84f14f529f7a498655275acda1ed5",
      "english": "Not Hamuko! Kimiko!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00006FC4",
      "source_words_sha256": "b4ddf83c7e156ffbe0151ba8607464a616127f5ab2fd048a67d8ed8f71b90deb",
      "english": "Only THEN do you get all lively, bastard.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000070DC",
      "source_words_sha256": "a6d7f7c93e2ba017df497f54b95a0c4bd632af4c88095947794eb6b2632d27ed",
      "english": "Oh? Aren't you in that girl's fan club...?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000071F0",
      "source_words_sha256": "0590425ee30e319a50b9285430ab61ca5b67859798fa0ec6f49456c59d892343",
      "english": "Yes! Shinpachi Shimura!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00007210",
      "source_words_sha256": "e075d8a9a0a0bfaeb40bd1852faaad2cc6ae0234045b7cc667d463e59a61f4dc",
      "english": "Yes! Gladly!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000725C",
      "source_words_sha256": "b8b918a5a1221c5f6f7d68baa67a1b67e22464d780e04e4759b15157f064c9b5",
      "english": "It's scary...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00007270",
      "source_words_sha256": "1475bdd9fd76022aad91f6c93d507a3e3ffbb38bcb8516cb1dfd90d99e910deb",
      "english": "...\fY-yeah. You can be anything. Anything you want.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000072C0",
      "source_words_sha256": "4cd2d7be4e6bfa1d4b3519bae991db6b469fea70a66f6dba4fc2d11cf8b0cb18",
      "english": "...No, really. Please, spare me.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00007378",
      "source_words_sha256": "dc888bf17494166d50189eed3829fecc4013505c7616f9e6b3f6ccb74c971c11",
      "english": "I want to be a flower.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000750C",
      "source_words_sha256": "ef97fd10c2f24a8271745615958000dc54d3b595c218d27cf9f13b6fa135f054",
      "english": "Captain! Good work collecting Gin Tama for Otsu!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000075D0",
      "source_words_sha256": "932043d560eb8938ee952593566c2c66eac7c4ce5724e6e6c61d27bb4b597042",
      "english": "Yes.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000077B0",
      "source_words_sha256": "00836f24de4eb014770b056df163db01b5b35e6e54c674e57b3df908680e58c9",
      "english": "Gengai fixed it, so it's fine.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00007838",
      "source_words_sha256": "5709b2271e8d272f4be7d209d2a07358b5e59de467af21049371afc1b478222c",
      "english": "Oh... Too bad.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00007850",
      "source_words_sha256": "4d914bcf964037bf0c409c4fbbcac6ee967b3156c9b4e6f7bf11546d7d2a6c01",
      "english": "Huh? Isn't this Gin Tama...?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000078A8",
      "source_words_sha256": "ae05a1bbd21ff1356cefb9bc5dd275cb3c20f1403495da280fb929adf5ce6bdf",
      "english": "Hey... If you get more Gin Tama, could you spare me some?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00007934",
      "source_words_sha256": "8fecc96aa415e01704b487ac275c66fee7de8d92112a91e4068c097e47031d45",
      "english": "It was broken? Sorry about that. Recycled goods, you know...\fI'll give you another fan when I get one. Forgive me.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000079BC",
      "source_words_sha256": "4bbea96c8ff20b206ff3084c68d1b7135b4be984dd5a995d1a72b6f54fc8dc1b",
      "english": "Still no greed, huh.\fThat's how you saved Earth, I suppose...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00007A6C",
      "source_words_sha256": "b94f7a78ec86679e8fbc88d2e3eabf3a284910f3de12253382a63c03586b97e8",
      "english": "Now, now. Don't look so down...\fHere. Take this.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00007AA8",
      "source_words_sha256": "33c1e6323b01079baa89dfb7e10f859e16778a14a475e5596724f88526a184d4",
      "english": "Customer brought it in. Told you, can't keep it at the shop. It's yours.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00007AF4",
      "source_words_sha256": "feba37b4f48052a8319bad252b213e40a49f043bf8175a0c98e3fb89fda66288",
      "english": "...Hehe.\fAll right. I'll think about it.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00007BC0",
      "source_words_sha256": "5586f321a26eb1d6874bd0bae7312497075471ec2aa350244a2cabb4a467e76c",
      "english": "Y-you?! The one who destroyed the Money Sealer!!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00007C78",
      "source_words_sha256": "231dc7b0c28efa2658466dea1e1f71cdbd809e9e5dfc2e64814a7a2d3839a438",
      "english": "Earth Defense Force! At last, revenge is mine!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00007CA4",
      "source_words_sha256": "d1618a77cf03b92485254d3b8af0c0d89976a59ed38e2a5036ac1a89dc23dbf2",
      "english": "Not what I meant!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00007CC0",
      "source_words_sha256": "067c144559a22e11d57c603d94bd421d5f8058a21c780610f6e03dfca6955b72",
      "english": "Not THAT either!\fOh... My head's starting to hurt...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00007D08",
      "source_words_sha256": "e2ed0cd1add83fec89bd1417f0e75033502717bdb04533833f684dc1ccc6b324",
      "english": "...\fWhy are people plotting evil always so persistent?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00007D70",
      "source_words_sha256": "e09f9015a69f3224683dda95a60ebddea977f97399d59564a35ba08ee9ab7cf6",
      "english": "Hi. Yorozuya here.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00007D88",
      "source_words_sha256": "bb4c8d423deb8d09e8e6c349c17cd3a3782668681cf94ddbd0f8a64a21df2004",
      "english": "It's fine. My face tightens up when it counts.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00007DB8",
      "source_words_sha256": "7d3a9eb7ca493657345a0839c683066f6935a799aed10ff461eeb2d9efe2d555",
      "english": "Oh, wrong guy, then. I'm still young.",
      "translator_note": null
    }
  ]
}
